  "source_notes": "street_v1 used source_before street_crossing and source_executed vertical driver. street_v2 used source_executed street/vertical. Interrupted streaming v1 loaded version is uncertain because source changed during launch; never use it as a baseline. Controlled v2/fire/carrier runs used source_executed snapshots. Front helper mask correction is still unverified in a full-surface run.",
